{"availability":"available","full":"RedtRocks/glance","name":"glance","description":"A free, open-source, lightweight viewer and editor for PDFs, images, camera RAW, 3D models, Office and Videos on Windows, Web and Linux with integration of your favourite AI Agents","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":1,"created":"2026-09-26T05:11:47Z","updated":"2026-10-08T07:30:00Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://redtrocks.github.io/glance/","topics":["3d-models","adobe-acrobat","claude-code","image-viewer","images","pdf","pdf-document","pdf-export","pdf-extraction","pdf-parser","pdf-tools","pdf-viewer","photo","photo-editing","photo-editor","photoshop","preview","raw-viewer","windows","windows-11"],"demo":"https://redtrocks.github.io/glance/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:26.840Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:26.840Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:26.840Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T07:35:26.840Z","stars":1,"forks":1}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A free, open-source Apple Preview alternative for Windows: a lightweight PDF viewer and editor, image viewer, camera RAW viewer and 3D model viewer.","⬇ Download for Windows · Microsoft Store · Open in your browser · Website · Features · 190+ file types · Build from source","Glance is a free, open-source alternative to Apple's macOS Preview app for Windows 10 and 11. It opens PDFs, images (including HEIC and camera RAW), 3D models, and Word, PowerPoint and Excel files in one small app, and brings Preview's everyday superpowers to Windows: rearranging and merging PDF pages by dragging, dragging pages out to create new files, real redaction, markup and signatures, background removal, metadata scrubbing, batch processing, and more. It's built to feel native on Windows 11 (Fluent design, Mica, Explorer integration) while staying small and fast. The same app also runs…"],"features":["Tauri 2 + WebView2: the UI runs in the Edge engine already built into Windows 10/11, so Glance doesn't ship its own browser. The installer is under 20 MB (about 18 MB for x64).","Rust backend: file access and image decoding run natively. Windows' own codecs come first (WIC), so camera RAW and HEIC work whenever Windows supports them.","Lazy engines: the startup bundle is 35 KB gzipped. PDF.js loads only when you open a PDF, pdf-lib only when you first edit one, and the 3D engine only for models.","Everything below works today unless it says otherwise.","Signing on an iPhone or iPad (Preview's Continuity feature) isn't possible on Windows; use the camera or a photo of your signature instead."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RedtRocks/glance/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"da14c210427d331f9ad4f26ac204fbf4ae79a8d07b24ef45c912d10859b7a919","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:27.173Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:27.173Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A free, open-source Apple Preview alternative for Windows: a lightweight PDF viewer and editor, image viewer, camera RAW viewer and 3D model viewer.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RedtRocks/glance/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"There's no account and nothing you open leaves your PC.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RedtRocks/glance/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"Sign in with your own account or paste an API key.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RedtRocks/glance/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Sign in with your own account or paste an API key.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RedtRocks/glance/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"Saved signatures and AI API keys are stored in your login keyring (Secret Service, such as GNOME Keyring or KWallet).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RedtRocks/glance/blob/main/README.md"}],"fing